01:20:12,664 --> 01:20:17,066
to because it's not there, except the dragon fish, which still can see red light and produces

1368
01:20:17,227 --> 01:20:18,287
red bioluminescence.

1369
01:20:18,927 --> 01:20:22,729
So it has spotlights that no one else can see it shining.

1370
01:20:22,749 --> 01:20:25,171
Oh, that's pretty cool.

1371
01:20:25,271 --> 01:20:29,993
So it can search food out and they don't realize they've been spotted because they can't see

