1393
01:21:35,349 --> 01:21:36,469
That's the chemical that does that.

1394
01:21:36,829 --> 01:21:41,151
And we find much higher degrees of it on average in deep sea fish versus shallow fish.

1395
01:21:41,971 --> 01:21:43,072
So they're smellier fish.

1396
01:21:43,112 --> 01:21:48,094
They would smell more like fish than other fish, but it works two ways.

1397
01:21:48,605 --> 01:21:55,108
Those chemicals are really good at deep waters and high pressures, not very good in low pressure.

1398
01:21:55,508 --> 01:21:59,330
So this does kind of lock those molecules to functioning at those pressures.

1399
01:21:59,971 --> 01:22:03,052
We see a similar thing with temperature because you're dealing with very cold temperatures.

